{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project: ASCESIS</strong> will offer you a first-person horror experience like you've never had before. You will explore two interconnected dimensions: the real world and a disturbing video game developed by the company your now-missing wife worked for.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A story to uncover, two realities to experience</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will be able to switch between realities, a crucial ability for solving puzzles, uncovering hidden secrets, and navigating a fragmented, mysterious narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846810/extras/5971a7d2309a7c77427e98a02c827a6a.poster.avif?t=1762113313\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846810/extras/5971a7d2309a7c77427e98a02c827a6a.webm?t=1762113313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846810/extras/5971a7d2309a7c77427e98a02c827a6a.mp4?t=1762113313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >90s environments with a retro-modern aesthetic, unsettling atmospheres, and a constant feeling that something isn\u2019t quite right. <br>Will you uncover the mystery behind the cancellation of <strong>ASCESIS</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846810/extras/99c01b21163ed019c0a8ce82f37f371b.poster.avif?t=1762113313\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846810/extras/99c01b21163ed019c0a8ce82f37f371b.webm?t=1762113313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846810/extras/99c01b21163ed019c0a8ce82f37f371b.mp4?t=1762113313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play the prologue</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover how it all began, enter a generated reality, and start searching for the truth. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve 3 different puzzles and uncover secret documents about Margaret\u2019s company. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use both realities to uncover what lies behind the mystery of ASCESIS.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846810/extras/9e93cc4e875391ef83885a51fd2f0c7f.poster.avif?t=1762113313\" width=800 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846810/extras/9e93cc4e875391ef83885a51fd2f0c7f.webm?t=1762113313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846810/extras/9e93cc4e875391ef83885a51fd2f0c7f.mp4?t=1762113313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What you will find in the full version</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New mechanics, puzzles, and environments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will uncover the whole truth behind this story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And remember... <strong>Keep Playing ASCESIS</strong>.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3846810?t=1762113313","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3846810?t=1762113313","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846810/9ab85c6d5adcba78b6f1831b0d91ebf8f965be92/